{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Define a lifecycle for stored references.** `store`/`load` provides no release signal or retention horizon. A successful store followed by checkpoint failure creates an orphan, while deleting committed data too early breaks replay, history inspection, or delayed root decoding. Specify cleanup ownership and the safe retention period, or add expiry/release lifecycle support, with checkpoint-failure and late-replay tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7poeLI","finding_digest":"cbd80416be2d263923233ff881c4ff9497a622d351208e9f464654df80f5c0ae","finding_id":"arf_v1_zpmaifv6futdsizdh74idrh7ss","finding_key":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md::payload-lifecycle::safe-retention-horizon","identity_key":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md::payload-lifecycle::safe-retention-horizon","line":305,"observation_digest":"a12a7c2af226f11c37b174c60155c53b549a19f91741bd327f395e23c503f0b1","observation_id":"aro_v1_uevhykxse3yryn5rotdacvofhn","path":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-02T23:40:25Z","review_id":"arr_v1_y5glwmc4oneokxagbuao6qqlil","reviewed_base_sha":"54b01c910cb06c69336afcb2c5f3f220fbe7b0b0","reviewed_head_sha":"4c6822cc220948aebb437a95ebe6acc0cb1c2175","reviewer":"codex","start_line":297,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":678},"record_id":"art_v1_rtplip5x4h67cwcg32cs7mnoyz","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-02T23:40:25Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
